  "body": "Project 10 still has unsynchronized roadmap metadata, while the remaining PRs need clear ownership and dependency order. This adds a review package for 26 open PRs and a scoped, resumable updater covering 332 issue-backed items (328 reviewed issues plus #806\u2013#809).\n\nThe five direct handoffs have evidence-backed disposition recommendations; none has been closed or rewritten. New remediation issues have their own parents and prerequisite/owner-blocker links. Runtime code and dependency locks are unchanged.\n\nReview entry point: [#737 package](https://github.com/dhar174/tiny_village/blob/codex/issue-737-coordination/docs/planning/issue-737/README.md), including the ownership matrix, five dispositions, field/view preview, validation report and downloadable portable package.\n\n**Publication is incomplete:** both credential routes receive Project FORBIDDEN; #806 blocks #737. No live Project delta/write/readback is claimed, and #738 remains Pending. Review the concrete live before/after plan before applying it; the field API lacks conditional writes, so apply requires a quiet edit window. This PR deliberately does not auto-close #737.\n\nValidation:\n- 43 offline synchronization/ordering checks pass; stale state, interrupted publication, preserved fields, source gates, duplicates and idempotence are covered.\n- Locked core: 72 tests + 3 CLI probes pass. Separate maintained cache suite: 27 pass.\n- Seven bounded investigation captures: four successful; unresolved helper-capability and silent prompt failures retained under #807/#808; one invalid initial distance-fixture assumption retained alongside the corrected real-Location result. No timeouts or erased failures.\n- 332-row preview validates with no dependency cycles/order conflicts; all 145 runtime/runner/lock hashes match main4821378. Portable extraction and deliberate corruption/missing-manifest checks verified on Linux. Independent read-only review findings addressed.\n\nLive Project mutations/view updates and native Windows execution remain unverified. Source queries have partial schema validation only; no gameplay or live-inference readiness is inferred.\n\nRefs #737. Separate next human gate: #738.\n\nHosted verification on head `836258d52672290c2961956be07d5baaa013fb4e`: Python core/dev/visual and `Python CI required` all pass ([run39816868742](https://github.com/dhar174/tiny_village/actions/runs/39816868742)); CodeQL checks also pass. These checks do not resolve Project authorization or the retained runtime criteria.\n",
